1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Third Episode
The Phantom Knight

15
00:01:55,181 --> 00:01:58,776
Now, before I tell you
today's story,

16
00:01:58,821 --> 00:02:01,210
I will summarize the last episode.

17
00:02:01,501 --> 00:02:03,969
One night,
the King was no longer to be found..

18
00:02:04,021 --> 00:02:06,216
...and people thought
that he was dead.

19
00:02:06,701 --> 00:02:09,818
Then Sapphire prepared
to become King.

20
00:02:14,301 --> 00:02:17,293
But during the ceremony
of coronation,

21
00:02:17,381 --> 00:02:21,260
the Queen was deceived
by Grand Duke Geralamon and Neelon

22
00:02:21,301 --> 00:02:23,371
and drank some drugged wine.

23
00:02:24,061 --> 00:02:26,370
Then the situation became serious.

24
00:02:26,421 --> 00:02:30,050
This drug had the effect
of making whoever drinks it say...

25
00:02:30,101 --> 00:02:32,092
everything they think.

26
00:02:32,141 --> 00:02:34,371
The Queen revealed the secret.

27
00:02:34,421 --> 00:02:37,572
In front of various representatives
gathered from all over the world,

28
00:02:37,621 --> 00:02:40,215
she confessed that Sapphire
was a girl.

29
00:02:40,421 --> 00:02:43,379
Therefore, Sapphire and the Queen
were condemned...

30
00:02:43,421 --> 00:02:47,130
...to be locked up in the
coffin tower as punishment.

31
00:02:48,541 --> 00:02:51,772
Today's story tells you
about what happened...

32
00:02:51,821 --> 00:02:55,018
...to the two of them while they were
locked in prison.

33
00:03:36,501 --> 00:03:39,015
Gama! Where is the jailer Gama?

34
00:03:40,101 --> 00:03:42,092
I'm here! I'm coming right away!

35
00:03:57,781 --> 00:04:00,898
- Mother!
- Try to stay calm

36
00:04:01,941 --> 00:04:04,011
Bring out Sapphire and the Queen!

37
00:04:05,301 --> 00:04:07,098
Mother, be careful.

38
00:04:07,621 --> 00:04:09,339
Thank you, Sapphire.

39
00:04:10,621 --> 00:04:13,897
Welcome,
Princess Sapphire and the Queen!

40
00:04:15,981 --> 00:04:18,176
Well, Gama,
I'll leave everything to you.

41
00:04:18,221 --> 00:04:19,893
- Let's go!
- Yes, sir!

42
00:04:19,941 --> 00:04:22,580
Yes, yes, alright, Captain.

43
00:04:25,661 --> 00:04:27,697
Now we can go.

44
00:04:40,901 --> 00:04:43,620
My God, how gloomy this tower is!

45
00:04:43,741 --> 00:04:45,811
Please, enter!

46
00:04:56,181 --> 00:04:58,456
What is this whistling sound?

47
00:04:58,701 --> 00:05:01,693
It's the wind. If you are afraid
of this simple noise,

48
00:05:01,741 --> 00:05:05,177
- you won't be able to live here.
- Where is our room?

49
00:05:05,821 --> 00:05:08,289
Go up the stairs and you will find her.

50
00:05:24,421 --> 00:05:27,140
- They are bats.
- How creepy!

51
00:05:27,181 --> 00:05:29,058
It's full of beasts here!

52
00:05:30,021 --> 00:05:31,773
We have arrived!

53
00:05:32,701 --> 00:05:34,896
This is your room.

54
00:05:39,261 --> 00:05:41,491
Isn't there a bed in this room?

55
00:05:41,541 --> 00:05:44,533
Bed?
Hey, bring those two beds!

56
00:05:44,701 --> 00:05:46,692
Yes, sir!

57
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:48,893
Who are they?

58
00:05:49,461 --> 00:05:51,452
They are my entourage!

59
00:05:51,501 --> 00:05:54,095
Give me that jewel
in exchange for the two beds

60
00:05:54,141 --> 00:05:56,894
Oh, no! This is
a dear keepsake of the King.

61
00:05:57,261 --> 00:05:59,900
Hey, then take back
the beds!

62
00:05:59,941 --> 00:06:01,897
Yes, sir!

63
00:06:02,261 --> 00:06:05,890
And then you will sleep
on the cold floor.

64
00:06:05,941 --> 00:06:07,772
- Listen, Gama...
- Sapphire!

65
00:06:07,821 --> 00:06:09,698
- Mother!
- Oh, alright.

66
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:16,610
- Hey, bring back the beds!
- Yes, sir!

67
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:18,777
Please, turn on the light.

68
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:23,294
- Hey, bring the lamps!
- Yes, sir!

69
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:27,693
Give me that brooch in
exchange for the lamps!

70
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:30,894
This is too much!
Now stop it! Enough!

71
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:34,536
- He says he doesn't need them anymore!
- Yes, sir!

72
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:37,573
Wait! We can't do without them.
Here!

73
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:53,019
We've been here for three days now.
Sapphire, you're hungry, aren't you?

74
00:06:54,460 --> 00:06:57,134
But you only had
a small breakfast.

75
00:06:58,380 --> 00:07:00,975
Do you want me to prepare dinner for you?

76
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:03,775
I wish you would,
but I have nothing left.

77
00:07:03,820 --> 00:07:05,812
You took all my jewels!

78
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:10,250
What do you mean "nothing"?
You still have those gorgeous clothes!

79
00:07:10,300 --> 00:07:13,179
If I give you these clothes,
will you give me others?

80
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:16,736
Of course I will give you others!
And very beautiful ones, too!

81
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:20,097
- Mother...!
- Very well.

82
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:26,135
Mother, what clothes!

83
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:30,015
It doesn't matter, we don't need
beautiful clothes here anymore.

84
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:33,771
Dinner is ready! Here you go!

85
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:37,177
Good heavens! And in exchange
you give us so little to eat?!

86
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:39,815
I'm fine, but I want
Sapphire to eat more!

87
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:43,778
Then you will need
many more jewels!

88
00:07:43,820 --> 00:07:45,971
But now I have nothing left!

89
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,569
Aren't you, perhaps,
hiding some?

90
00:07:48,620 --> 00:07:51,089
No! Really,
I have nothing left.

91
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:53,496
Nothing! You have nothing, huh?

92
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:56,260
Then you will do the washing
and the Princess will sweep!

93
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:58,690
What?! You are ordering
my mother to wash...

94
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:01,175
- Silence!
- Sapphire!

95
00:08:02,220 --> 00:08:05,975
You will have to work a lot
and hard too, if you want to eat!

96
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:14,336
- You're cheerful, Sapphire.
- Yes! Better to sing than to cry!

97
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:22,093
And besides, I must say
that singing helps me work!

98
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:24,496
You're right! It helps
me too, you know?

99
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:28,893
Damn you!

100
00:08:30,820 --> 00:08:33,335
Don't waste time chattering!

101
00:08:44,901 --> 00:08:48,052
And now let's see where
I can throw this garbage.

102
00:08:48,461 --> 00:08:50,292
Ah, there! I found it!

103
00:08:50,981 --> 00:08:52,972
I'll throw them out of here!

104
00:09:04,701 --> 00:09:06,817
My God, this is Gama's room!

105
00:09:10,021 --> 00:09:14,253
Damn it! If you play another
trick like that on me, I'll kill you!

106
00:09:14,301 --> 00:09:17,020
Forgive me, but I didn't
know it was your room!

107
00:09:17,061 --> 00:09:21,532
Instead of going to dinner, you
will clean the floor! Understood?

108
00:09:27,381 --> 00:09:31,374
Alright, let's see...
Where is the cleaning rag?

109
00:09:31,901 --> 00:09:34,051
Ah, here it is! I found it!

110
00:10:36,901 --> 00:10:41,019
If you sing, you can't
clean well! Give it to me!

111
00:10:41,261 --> 00:10:45,220
Look how it's done!
How dirty this rag is!

112
00:10:48,541 --> 00:10:51,578
But these are my
clothes! Damn you!

113
00:10:51,621 --> 00:10:53,691
Your clothes?! Help!

114
00:10:53,741 --> 00:10:56,301
Come here, so I can strangle you!

115
00:11:06,141 --> 00:11:10,692
Take that! Oh, no!
All my lunch! No!

116
00:11:13,141 --> 00:11:16,019
I'll have to go hungry
and I also have a headache!

117
00:11:16,061 --> 00:11:20,293
You, meanwhile, will go to work
without eating! Go on, get out!

118
00:11:30,981 --> 00:11:35,338
And then, soon, we will see the sun...

119
00:11:36,141 --> 00:11:38,701
Stop it! Stop singing!

120
00:11:38,741 --> 00:11:41,460
Think about grinding
and making good bread!

121
00:11:41,501 --> 00:11:44,015
I will eat it, you damned idiot!

122
00:11:47,821 --> 00:11:51,450
But that's a mouse!
Wait, thief mouse!

123
00:11:58,901 --> 00:12:00,573
My God...!

124
00:12:08,901 --> 00:12:10,653
Give it here!

125
00:12:16,061 --> 00:12:20,259
Listen to me carefully! You will kill
all the mice in this tower!

126
00:12:20,581 --> 00:12:22,811
No! They are God's creatures!

127
00:12:33,781 --> 00:12:35,612
I'm very hungry.

128
00:12:35,661 --> 00:12:38,892
Tomorrow you can eat
my lunch too.

129
00:12:39,181 --> 00:12:42,776
- I'm so happy!
- Good heavens! Why?

130
00:12:43,021 --> 00:12:46,650
Because even if we suffer,
we can be together so much.

131
00:12:47,541 --> 00:12:50,897
If only dad
could be here with us...

132
00:12:50,941 --> 00:12:52,932
You promised not to cry.

133
00:12:53,901 --> 00:12:57,450
- I'm sorry.
- It's not so bad here.

134
00:12:57,741 --> 00:13:00,778
There is no one
plotting against us,

135
00:13:00,821 --> 00:13:04,097
there is no Geralamon
and not even Neelon.

136
00:13:04,141 --> 00:13:08,817
Thank you, Sapphire! When I look at you,
I feel great courage.

137
00:13:09,581 --> 00:13:13,369
Yes...
But I'm so hungry!

138
00:13:22,181 --> 00:13:25,412
Did you come to thank me?
Don't worry!

139
00:13:29,221 --> 00:13:32,338
Look, mother!
They brought us food!

140
00:13:37,941 --> 00:13:40,409
Splendid! Another one!

141
00:13:42,781 --> 00:13:46,899
This is a notice! "From now on,
no one shall speak of Sapphire.

142
00:13:46,941 --> 00:13:50,570
Whoever utters his name will
be whipped a hundred times...

143
00:13:50,621 --> 00:13:54,136
...and will be sentenced to
slavery. Grand Duke Geralamon".

144
00:13:54,181 --> 00:13:57,412
That cursed Geralamon
is ruling like a tyrant!

145
00:13:57,461 --> 00:13:58,894
Right, mother?

146
00:13:58,941 --> 00:14:01,899
I am sure that this
notice is not the only one!

147
00:14:01,941 --> 00:14:05,490
Now that my father and I
are not here, he's hard at work!

148
00:14:06,301 --> 00:14:08,496
How I wish I could get out of here!

149
00:14:10,421 --> 00:14:12,571
What are they doing?

150
00:14:19,181 --> 00:14:21,297
Mother, look!

151
00:14:22,301 --> 00:14:24,417
What is this hole?

152
00:14:24,701 --> 00:14:28,171
How deep it is!
I think it leads to the dungeons.

153
00:14:30,221 --> 00:14:32,496
Be careful, it's very narrow!

154
00:15:08,501 --> 00:15:10,731
I'm out!

155
00:15:11,061 --> 00:15:14,178
How wonderful! Thank you!
Thank you, little mice!

156
00:15:24,701 --> 00:15:28,011
- Sapphire! - Mother, there's an exit
this way!

157
00:15:29,141 --> 00:15:32,372
- Come!
- Now let's get out of this place!

158
00:15:32,901 --> 00:15:36,735
This hole is too small
for me. Escape by yourself.

159
00:15:36,981 --> 00:15:39,700
No! I will never be separated from you!

160
00:15:39,901 --> 00:15:42,540
No, you must escape, Sapphire,

161
00:15:42,581 --> 00:15:45,141
and fight
against our enemies.

162
00:15:46,701 --> 00:15:48,692
Gama is coming!

163
00:15:50,501 --> 00:15:53,334
May I know
what you are whispering?

164
00:15:54,781 --> 00:15:58,171
Nothing! I was only saying
that I'm hungry! So hungry!

165
00:15:58,341 --> 00:16:01,094
Don't tell me stories!
I'm not buying it!

166
00:16:01,141 --> 00:16:03,450
You were planning to escape, huh?

167
00:16:03,501 --> 00:16:07,779
Remember that, if you escape,
I will cut off the Queen's head!

168
00:16:07,981 --> 00:16:11,098
- My God! - What?!
- Geralamon ordered me to!

169
00:16:12,981 --> 00:16:16,098
- Mother!
- Don't worry about me.

170
00:16:16,141 --> 00:16:18,496
Get out of here right now
and go fight!

171
00:16:18,541 --> 00:16:21,374
This is your duty
as Prince of Silverland.

172
00:16:21,421 --> 00:16:24,333
But if they should catch me, you..

173
00:16:24,581 --> 00:16:27,539
Sapphire, what is more important?
My life...

174
00:16:27,581 --> 00:16:30,459
...or the life of so many poor
people who, at this moment,

175
00:16:30,501 --> 00:16:32,890
are suffering
under cruel laws?

176
00:16:38,781 --> 00:16:40,897
- Mother, look!
- Look at those little mice!

177
00:16:46,341 --> 00:16:48,457
My sword and my clothes!

178
00:16:48,501 --> 00:16:50,776
You took them from Gama's room,
right?

179
00:17:16,421 --> 00:17:18,537
Go ahead, whip him!

180
00:17:24,221 --> 00:17:27,691
Listen to me well, everyone!
This man spoke of Sapphire

181
00:17:27,741 --> 00:17:29,891
...and called King Plastic
an "idiot",

182
00:17:29,941 --> 00:17:32,011
therefore he was whipped

183
00:17:32,061 --> 00:17:34,416
...and now he will work as a
slave for the rest of his life!

184
00:17:34,461 --> 00:17:36,975
He will be a slave for his whole life!

185
00:17:37,421 --> 00:17:39,332
Poor boy..!

186
00:17:44,901 --> 00:17:46,892
No! No!

187
00:17:46,941 --> 00:17:49,501
This cursed child
was praising Sapphire!

188
00:17:49,541 --> 00:17:53,170
- What?!
- Sapphire was very kind!

189
00:17:53,221 --> 00:17:55,735
Plastic is an idiot and an imbecile!

190
00:17:55,781 --> 00:17:58,773
Wretched child!
Whip him!

191
00:17:58,821 --> 00:18:01,176
He will not be spared just
because he is a child! Go on!

192
00:18:02,021 --> 00:18:06,697
Oh, my son! He is my only
son! Please, forgive him!

193
00:18:06,741 --> 00:18:09,175
No! No! Go away, or
you will be whipped too!

194
00:18:09,221 --> 00:18:12,611
- Come on, hurry up! Go!
- Wait!

195
00:18:40,221 --> 00:18:42,337
Damn it! And who are you?

196
00:18:44,901 --> 00:18:47,495
I am the phantom knight!
Remember me!

197
00:18:47,541 --> 00:18:49,577
What?! The phantom knight?!

198
00:18:49,621 --> 00:18:52,260
He's a suspicious man! Arrest him!

199
00:19:01,301 --> 00:19:03,769
What are you doing?
Have you given up already?

200
00:19:03,821 --> 00:19:06,210
How dare you challenge me, brat?

201
00:19:22,541 --> 00:19:25,613
You dared to challenge
me I'll make you pay!

202
00:19:28,181 --> 00:19:30,456
Hooray! Hooray!

203
00:19:30,501 --> 00:19:34,779
Boy, cut the rope of the
prisoners with this sword!

204
00:19:35,541 --> 00:19:37,452
Thank you, phantom knight!

205
00:19:37,501 --> 00:19:40,493
Knight, please, will
you show me your face?

206
00:19:40,541 --> 00:19:43,260
No, I cannot do it! Farewell!

207
00:20:04,701 --> 00:20:06,817
Well, I never..! Well, I never!

208
00:20:10,421 --> 00:20:13,777
You look like an idiot!
Are you hungry?

209
00:20:14,301 --> 00:20:18,055
You are a complete idiot!
Get out of the way, Plastic!

210
00:20:18,621 --> 00:20:20,532
What's happening, Neelon?

211
00:20:21,221 --> 00:20:23,212
Well, please listen to me!

212
00:20:23,261 --> 00:20:25,536
Suddenly
a strange guy appeared!

213
00:20:25,581 --> 00:20:28,732
He freed all the prisoners
and let them escape!

214
00:20:29,061 --> 00:20:30,892
A strange guy?!

215
00:20:30,981 --> 00:20:33,779
Yes! He was very strange!
He was three meters tall!

216
00:20:33,821 --> 00:20:36,381
We could have beaten
him, if he hadn't been so tall!

217
00:20:36,421 --> 00:20:39,015
- Extremely tall!
- Don't talk nonsense!

218
00:20:41,461 --> 00:20:43,691
Damn it, there he is!

219
00:20:44,341 --> 00:20:46,901
Is he the strange guy?

220
00:20:46,941 --> 00:20:50,616
Soldiers! Soldiers!
That guy is a scoundrel!

221
00:20:50,661 --> 00:20:53,892
He's near the window!
Attack him from all sides!

222
00:20:53,941 --> 00:20:57,616
Appost yourselves outside the window!
Don't let him escape!

223
00:20:57,901 --> 00:20:59,892
It's just you and me, Geralamon!

224
00:21:08,421 --> 00:21:11,493
How dare he break
my beautiful bookcase?

225
00:21:11,541 --> 00:21:13,930
- Catch him immediately!
- Catch him immediately!

226
00:21:14,141 --> 00:21:15,620
Get him!

227
00:21:17,701 --> 00:21:21,979
Remember, arrogant Geralamon: if
you make people suffer again,

228
00:21:22,021 --> 00:21:25,297
the phantom knight will kill you!
Remember it well!

229
00:21:28,501 --> 00:21:31,140
What are you doing? Get him!

230
00:21:33,261 --> 00:21:35,297
What is it, Neelon?

231
00:21:35,341 --> 00:21:38,777
Don't you think his voice
sounds a lot like Sapphire's?

232
00:21:39,381 --> 00:21:41,258
What?! Sapphire?!

233
00:21:42,301 --> 00:21:45,338
Yes!
Let's split into two teams!

234
00:21:45,381 --> 00:21:47,975
One will hunt the knight and
the other goes to the coffin tower...

235
00:21:48,021 --> 00:21:49,977
...to see if Sapphire
is there or not!

236
00:21:50,581 --> 00:21:55,291
Go! The phantom knight...
could be Sapphire...

237
00:22:26,341 --> 00:22:29,617
Neelon has become alarmed and is going
to inspect the coffin tower.

238
00:22:29,661 --> 00:22:32,937
I must hurry back,
or my mother will be in danger!

239
00:22:46,581 --> 00:22:49,095
Gama! Where is Gama? It's Neelon!

240
00:22:49,141 --> 00:22:51,496
- Open the door immediately!
- Yes!

241
00:22:51,901 --> 00:22:53,493
Go away!

242
00:23:02,381 --> 00:23:05,373
Hello, Nylon! Your nose
is getting bigger and bigger! How come?

243
00:23:05,421 --> 00:23:07,616
Damn it!
I was sure it was Sapphire!

244
00:23:09,701 --> 00:23:12,261
I'm sorry if I'm a bit late

245
00:23:12,421 --> 00:23:14,537
Now I'm more relieved

246
00:23:15,141 --> 00:23:18,178
If you were any later,
I would have really worried.

247
00:23:18,901 --> 00:23:21,017
Oh, how sweaty you are..

248
00:23:24,301 --> 00:23:27,976
Good! So Sapphire
was in the Coffin Tower!

249
00:23:28,021 --> 00:23:31,616
Yes! As long as you leave them alive,
we'll have problems!

250
00:23:32,061 --> 00:23:33,619
Let's kill them!

251
00:23:34,901 --> 00:23:36,892
I've already thought of that.

252
00:23:37,261 --> 00:23:40,537
I sent five assassins
to the tower,

253
00:23:40,901 --> 00:23:43,335
with the order to kill them!

254
00:23:47,261 --> 00:23:51,459
By now
they must have already arrived

255
